SUMMARY:Old Fort Boxing Day 5KM/3 mile Walk
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMeet at Old Fort Town Hal
 l\, 38 Catawba Avenue\, at 12:00 noon. (I'm not sure how difficult parking
  will be\, so come a bit early just in case.) We will walk\, making a leis
 urely loop of the route some 5 KM runs follow.\n\nWe will see parts of the
  town and a bit of countryside as well.\n\nDress for the weather. Tennis s
 hoes should be fine. There is some elevation change\; I plan to take a wal
 king stick\, though most won't need one. Bring plenty of water and a prote
 in snack. Dogs are welcome. Strollers should be ok.\n\nIf you don't want t
 o face crowds in the stores exchanging gifts\, this Boxing Day walk just m
 ight fit the bill. I hope to see you there.
